BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.27 rg 56 670 Td (notices and stays quiet. If they get thanks, the team notices that too. Psychological) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.27 rg 56 655 Td (safety is not the same as being comfortable. A safe team can still disagree strongly,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.27 rg 56 640 Td (because people trust that the disagreement is about the work, not about them.) Tj ET
