BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.27 rg 56 494 Td (Look for the signs. Meetings where nobody disagrees and then people complain) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.27 rg 56 479 Td (afterwards. Decisions that are agreed in the room and quietly reopened later. A habit) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.27 rg 56 464 Td (of finding who is to blame when something goes wrong, rather than what can be learned.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.27 rg 56 449 Td (People checking and double checking each other's work. None of these mean the team is) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.27 rg 56 434 Td (bad. They mean that people do not feel safe being open. Spotting the pattern early) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.27 rg 56 419 Td (gives you a chance to address it before it becomes the way the team works.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.27 rg 56 404 Td () Tj ET
