BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.27 rg 56 303 Td (- Make it visible and review it) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.27 rg 56 288 Td () Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.27 rg 56 273 Td (A team charter is a short agreement on how you will work together. It covers things) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.27 rg 56 258 Td (like how you give feedback, how you make decisions, how quickly you reply, and what) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.27 rg 56 243 Td (you do when you disagree. Run it as a session where everyone contributes, rather than) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.27 rg 56 228 Td (something the manager writes alone. Keep the language simple and use the team's own) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.27 rg 56 213 Td (words. Then make it visible, on a shared page or at the start of meetings, and review) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.27 rg 56 198 Td (it every few months. A charter that lives in a drawer changes nothing.) Tj ET
