BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.27 rg 56 670 Td () Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.27 rg 56 655 Td (To run the charter session, start by asking what already works well, so the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.27 rg 56 640 Td (conversation begins from strength. Let people write their ideas individually before) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.27 rg 56 625 Td (sharing, so that quieter members are not drowned out. Group the ideas into themes,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.27 rg 56 610 Td (then agree on three to five commitments that everyone can actually keep. More than) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.27 rg 56 595 Td (that, and nobody remembers them. End by deciding how you will remind each other, and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.27 rg 56 580 Td (when you will review. The conversation matters as much as the document, because that) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.27 rg 56 565 Td (is where people learn what others expect.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.27 rg 56 550 Td () Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 0.094 0.094 0.106 rg 56 529 Td (Working through team tensions) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.27 rg 56 509 Td (- Name the tension without blaming) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.27 rg 56 494 Td () Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.27 rg 56 479 Td (- Separate the issue from the person) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.27 rg 56 464 Td () Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.27 rg 56 449 Td (- Agree one small change to try) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.27 rg 56 434 Td () Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.27 rg 56 419 Td (Every team has tensions. The aim is not to remove them but to work through them. Name) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.27 rg 56 404 Td (the tension in neutral terms, for example, we seem to have different views on how fast) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.27 rg 56 389 Td (to move. Separate the issue from the person, so that it does not become personal. Ask) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.27 rg 56 374 Td (each side what matters most to them. Then agree one small change to try for two weeks,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.27 rg 56 359 Td (and review it. Small experiments are easier to agree to than large demands, and they) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.27 rg 56 344 Td (build the habit of resolving things instead of avoiding them.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.27 rg 56 329 Td () Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 0.094 0.094 0.106 rg 56 308 Td (The monthly team health check) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.27 rg 56 288 Td (- Three questions: trust, clarity, energy) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.27 rg 56 273 Td () Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.27 rg 56 258 Td (- Anonymous scores and open discussion) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.27 rg 56 243 Td () Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.27 rg 56 228 Td (- One action each month) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.27 rg 56 213 Td () Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.27 rg 56 198 Td (A monthly health check keeps trust from drifting. Ask three simple questions. How much) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.27 rg 56 183 Td (do we trust each other to be open. How clear are we on our goals and roles. How is our) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.27 rg 56 168 Td (energy. Collect scores anonymously, then discuss the results together. Do not try to) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.27 rg 56 153 Td (fix everything. Choose one action for the month and write down who owns it. Over time,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.27 rg 56 138 Td (you will see the scores move, and you will have a record of what worked. Consistency) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.27 rg 56 123 Td (matters more than sophistication, so keep it short and keep it regular.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.27 rg 56 108 Td () Tj ET
